msgid "USB is provided as the primary port for the autopilot configuration. It always appears as the first serial port (SERIAL0) on the autopilot. See :ref:`Serial Port Configuration <common-serial-options>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:60
#: 241ad3ad3fb64e8fb11e0e127f724e8e
